# Project workflow

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/STATUS.md`, and the active `tasks/*.md` first.
- Treat code, migrations, configuration, and tests as source of truth.
- Complete one task and its acceptance checks before starting another.
- Keep the MVP read-only and matching deterministic.
- Record incomplete data access as `unknown`, never `matched`.
- Update status and the active checklist with verified facts only.
